{"3558260": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "奈布的冒险 - Naib's Adventure", "steam_appid": 3558260, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >雇佣兵奈布收到了一份来自湖景村的委托——讨伐一个诅咒了整个村庄的“邪神”。 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >那名红发的女人提出了一个诱人的报酬：她声称，能够治愈奈布长期以来被噩梦折磨的心灵。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 为了摆脱梦魇，奈布踏上了前往湖景村的旅途。 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >他并不知道，这趟旅程将带他直面过去的创伤，也将揭开隐藏在诡异宁静下的真相。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >游戏特色： </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >以像素风格为主的美术设计 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >多个结局，根据玩家的选择和行动触发后将发生变化 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >基本操作仅需要移动交互/对话/攻击（空格键）</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >雇佣兵奈布收到了一份来自湖景村的委托——讨伐一个诅咒了整个村庄的“邪神”。 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >那名红发的女人提出了一个诱人的报酬：她声称，能够治愈奈布长期以来被噩梦折磨的心灵。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 为了摆脱梦魇，奈布踏上了前往湖景村的旅途。 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >他并不知道，这趟旅程将带他直面过去的创伤，也将揭开隐藏在诡异宁静下的真相。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >游戏特色： </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >以像素风格为主的美术设计 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >多个结局，根据玩家的选择和行动触发后将发生变化 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >基本操作仅需要移动交互/对话/攻击（空格键）</p>", "short_description": "Naib's Adventure is a fan-made RPG inspired by the world of Identity V. In this game, you will take on the role of the battle-hardened mercenary, Naib Subedar, who receives a mysterious commission from the priestess Fiona to investigate a cursed and remote village.", "supported_languages": "Simplified Chinese<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558260/d359fa68c3e32090113653e008390ed5ef4321d8/header.jpg?t=1762449883", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558260/667efc16705e801bab283883535a765be30df82f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762449883", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558260/6